{"route":"/bim-services/scan-to-bim/","title":"Scan-to-BIM Services in Dubai & UAE | ENGISOFT","description":"Point-cloud to as-built Revit models for refurbishment, fit-out and facility management. Delivered by ENGISOFT in Dubai and the GCC.","robots":"max-image-preview:large","canonical":"https://engisoftengineering.com/bim-services/scan-to-bim/","og":{"type":"article","title":"Scan-to-BIM Services in Dubai & UAE | ENGISOFT","description":"Point-cloud to as-built Revit models for refurbishment, fit-out and facility management. Delivered by ENGISOFT in Dubai and the GCC.","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/bim-services/scan-to-bim/","image":"https://engisoftengineering.com/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan.jpg","siteName":"ENGISOFT Engineering","locale":"en_US"},"twitter":"summary_large_image","jsonld":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ProfessionalService","@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization","name":"ENGISOFT Engineering","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/","logo":"https://engisoftengineering.com/wp-content/themes/engisoft/assets/img/favicon.svg","image":"https://engisoftengineering.com/wp-content/uploads/engisoft-media/img/c-hand.jpg","email":"enquiry@engisoftengineering.com","telephone":"+971 58 867 2901","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Office 608, Apricot Tower","addressLocality":"Dubai","addressRegion":"Dubai Silicon Oasis","addressCountry":"AE"},"areaServed":["AE","SA","QA","BH","KW","OM"],"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/14517437/","https://www.instagram.com/engisoft.engineering/","https://www.facebook.com/Global.BIM.Leader","https://twitter.com/ENGISOFTDUBAI"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#website","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/","name":"ENGISOFT Engineering","publisher":{"@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization"}},{"@type":"Service","name":"Scan-to-BIM","description":"Point-cloud to as-built Revit models for refurbishment, fit-out and facility management. Delivered by ENGISOFT in Dubai and the GCC.","url":"https://engisoftengineering.com/bim-services/scan-to-bim/","serviceType":"Scan-to-BIM","provider":{"@id":"https://engisoftengineering.com/#organization"},"areaServed":["AE","SA","QA","BH","KW","OM"]}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"BIM Services","item":"https://engisoftengineering.com/bim-services/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Scan-to-BIM","item":"https://engisoftengineering.com/bim-services/scan-to-bim/"}]}]}],"caseStudy":false,"main":"\n<section class=\"ph\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan.jpg\" class=\"ph-media\" alt=\"Surveyor using a total station on a construction site\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-scan-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><div class=\"ph-in\"><div><p class=\"crumb ph-a\"><a href=\"/bim-services/\">BIM Services</a> / 04</p><h1 class=\"h1 ph-a\">Scan-to-BIM<br><em>The building as it stands.</em></h1></div><p class=\"lead ph-a\">Point-cloud to as-built Revit models for refurbishment, fit-out and facility management.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Proposition</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Registered point clouds converted into <em>usable, tolerance-aware as-built models.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/contact/?service=Scan-to-BIM\">Request this service <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\">\n    <div><p class=\"lab\">Available disciplines</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>Architecture</li><li>Structure</li><li>MEP</li></ul></div>    <div><p class=\"lab\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">Typical tools</p><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>ReCap</span><span>Revit</span><span>Cloud Compare</span></div></div>  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">From the portfolio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Scan-to-BIM <em>delivered.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/case-studies/#register\">Portfolio register <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/commercial-scan-to-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Scan to BIM: Commercial Building</b><span>Sharjah</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/scan-to-bim-villa-renovation/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Scan to BIM: Villa Renovation</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/scan-to-bim-retail-space-refurbishment/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Scan to BIM: Retail Space Refurbishment</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/as-built-bim-hospital-and-healthcare-facility/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>As-Built BIM: Hospital &#038; Healthcare Facility</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300–400</span></a></li></ul>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap scanx\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Point cloud to model</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">From millions of points <em>to one model.</em></h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A scan station captures the building as it stands. The registered cloud is then traced into clean, tolerance-checked Revit geometry.</p>\n  <ol class=\"phase\" id=\"phases\"><li class=\"on\"><b>01</b>Capture and register the scan</li><li><b>02</b>Clean, segment and align the cloud</li><li><b>03</b>Model to scan and check deviation</li></ol></div>\n  <div class=\"viewer\"><canvas id=\"bimScan\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation of a laser scan point cloud resolving into a BIM model\"></canvas><div class=\"vhud\"><span><b>Reality capture</b> &middot; E57 / RCP</span><span>LOD 300</span></div><div class=\"vfoot\"><span>Points coloured by height</span><span>Drag to orbit</span></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How Scan-to-BIM <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Point cloud prep</h3><p>Scans registered, cleaned and segmented by level and zone, then linked to shared coordinates.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Modelling to scan</h3><p>Walls, structure and services modelled against the cloud, section by section.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Deviation check</h3><p>Model compared with the cloud and deviations reported against the agreed tolerance.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap pn\">\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/bim-management/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Two engineers reviewing a 3D model on a laptop\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Previous service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">BIM Management</h2></a>\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/architectural-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Curved glass curtain wall facade\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" /><span class=\"lab\">Next service</span><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Architectural BIM</h2></a>\n</div></section>\n","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/dxb-night-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/dxb-night.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/dxb-night.jpg\" alt=\"Dubai Marina towers lit at night\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Start your <em>Scan-to-BIM scope.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/request-talent/\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"tel:+971588672901\">+971 58 867 2901</a></div>"}